<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The disciples woke Him,</l><l>They were scared as they could be,</l><l>They were scared as they could be,</l><l>They were scared as they could be.</l><l>The disciples woke Him,</l><l>They were scared as they could be,</l><l>On the rocking, rolling boat.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus said to the surging sea,</l><l>“Be silent and be still!”</l><l>“Be silent and be still!”</l><l>“Be silent and be still!”</l><l>Jesus said to the surging sea,</l><l>“Be silent and be still!”</l><l>And the rocking, rolling stopped!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
